{
  "slug": "qodo",
  "name": "Qodo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Bring Qodo's codebase intelligence, coding standards, and code review into your coding agent.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `qodo-codebase-wisdom` (Understand how code works, how a change was done before, and which repos are coupled — to answer…), `qodo-pr-resolver` (Compatibility alias for explicit qodo-pr-resolver requests), `qodo-review` (Review your LOCAL changes before opening a pull request, using the qodo CLI — send your uncommitted/unpushed diff…), `qodo-review-resolver` (Read or resolve a pull request's Qodo review with the qodo CLI — fetch the structured status, reviewed…), `qodo-setup` (Connect Qodo to the current local coding agent — verify the Qodo CLI, guide a secure installation when…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install qodo@claude-plugins-official` from `qodo-ai/qodo-skills` (`packages/qodo`).",
